  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "USB Audio: Fix version formatting",
  "description": "Handle the bcdADC fields like bsdUSB as an unsigned integer. This\nreplaces the float arithmetic and locale-dependant formatting, which\nresulted in using a comma for the version with locales that use it as\ndecimal separator.\n\n```\nClass-specific Audio Control Interface Descriptor: Header Descriptor\n    Version: 1,00\n```\n\nFixes: a2e99f56 (\"distinguish between different audio descriptor types and subtypes\")",
